{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id272825105"}, "name":{"label":"rpgbx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-11-16T01:23:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"5148114685"}, "title":{"label":"Simply incredible."}, "content":{"label":"Underwater and (now with update) Spaceship have helped me fall asleep consistently since Day 1 of downloading this app. I rarely sleep without it now. It’s also helped me wake up, since I become acutely aware the moment the timer stops the sound and my body naturally wakes up, miraculously 5 minutes before my alarm is set to ring. Unbelievable, especially as someone actively recovering from social media addiction (I previously suffered from anxiety driven largely by Facebook/IG, had a difficult time sleeping for more than a few hours, etc.) I am so grateful I found this app on Product Hunt.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
