{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id111250947"}, "name":{"label":"Tethys-Sea"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-10-13T13:14:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4942106772"}, "title":{"label":"Sublime"}, "content":{"label":"Beyond the magnificent user interface, there are exquisitely curated sounds. That’s simply what Dark Noise is all about. It is extraordinary. \n\nAnd then (this is key) the dev of Dark Noise is responsive. An email query about an issue gets addressed rapidly; counts for a lot in my book. \n\nThings happen and not always within the control of the developer. Always prefer to check-in with the dev directly before posting an issue or question here.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id115092154"}, "name":{"label":"CoolieRanx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-10-12T09:52:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4932299168"}, "title":{"label":"Great UI, but the sounds aren’t very good"}, "content":{"label":"While I appreciate this app’s pretty stellar UI, the actual core functionality of Dark Noise—playing sounds—is really poor. The sounds are low quality and really tinny, and they need to be played at too high a volume. When the developer addresses this, I will gladly return.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
