{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26172943"}, "name":{"label":"Kronusdark"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-31T17:23:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4705723390"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, quality of recordings could be improved."}, "content":{"label":"First, this app is a great example on how to stay simple and fit well with the ecosystem. \n\nThe UI is excellent, and it is super easy to use. \n\n👏👏👏\n\nBravo\n\nThat said, I feel like the recording of some of the sounds are a bit sub par. I saw on reddit that you wanted to keep the download size small, and I totally agree, but it would be nice to have an in app option to fetch higher quality recordings. \n\nSide note: some of the sounds would pop a bit better with dummy head recording, have you looked into this?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
