{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43245467"}, "name":{"label":"WinterCharm"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-31T09:42:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4703662846"}, "title":{"label":"Best White / Dark noise generator!"}, "content":{"label":"What I love: \n\n* tons of options so we can have exactly the sounds we prefer\n* supports all the latest iOS features (huge deal) \n* amazing animations and visual style combined with haptics. The app really feels alive when you use it \n* works exactly as promised\n* lots of settings and customization\n\n10/10 - this is the background noise app you NEED.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25394310"}, "name":{"label":"SasparillaFizz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-08-28T19:00:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1"}, "id":{"label":"4687869510"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome sound app"}, "content":{"label":"On the surface, it’s an absolute ball to play with and use.  Dig a little deeper and quality touches stick out (sound that doesn’t loop noticeably), the icon animations for each sound.  Awesome.  It’s been so long since I just had fun with a non game app...till Dark Noise.  Can’t go on though, have to get back to playing with this app...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
